[NEW] &lt;p&gt;Save time entering information into Business Central with Auto paste. Building on Autofill, Auto paste uses AI to identify relevant information from text or HTML copied to your clipboard and map it to the appropriate fields on a Business Central page.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reduc (GA: April CY2027) — Dynamics 365 Business Central

[NEW] &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Personal settings&lt;/strong&gt; experience in model-driven apps has been modernized with clearer organization, updated navigation, and a more consistent design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Users can select a button to return to the classic &lt;strong&gt;Personal settings&lt;/strong&gt; experience if needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Availa (GA: December CY2026) — Power Apps

[NEW] &lt;p&gt;Project to Profit value chain mainly contains business processes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Govern projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project resources and schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project financials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and analyze project performance&lt;/li&gt; (GA: December CY2027) — Dynamics 365 Finance

[NEW] &lt;p&gt;Some of the most commonly used business processes that project managers perform during subcontract management include the following tasks:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Modify subcontract line&lt;br&gt;
Track subcontract usage&lt;br&gt;
Monitor billing progress for subcontracts&lt;br&gt;
Currently, project managers need to use multiple  (GA: August CY2027) — Dynamics 365 Project Operations

[NEW] &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applies to&lt;/strong&gt;: Point of Sale (Store Commerce)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Setup&lt;/strong&gt;: Store admin configures the control in the Commerce headquarters screen layout designer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can add a new &lt;strong&gt;Quick Operations control&lt;/strong&gt; to the transaction screen layout in the headquarter (GA: December CY2026) — Dynamics 365 Commerce

&lt;p&gt;Real-time streaming analytics is built into the new supervisor application. An advanced streaming engine keeps metrics up to date with near-instant updates, allowing supervisors to view the latest data without refreshing the dashboard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key capabilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continu (GA: October CY2026) — Dynamics 365 Contact Center

&lt;p&gt;Currently, to bring tasks from another project into a new project, you must manually enter the task details in the task grid or use schedule APIs. You can also use the &lt;strong&gt;Copy project&lt;/strong&gt; feature to create a new project with the same tasks, but this feature has limitations:&lt;br&gt;
